    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shyondemic</strong> Is a Pandemic Survival game set in a Furry city experiencing a pandemic. Drawing inspiration from real-world events like COVID-19, the game recreates the experience of quarantine and survival during a pandemic but more fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303740/extras/c46dadb7798f1dec3515aed4c35eb3ed.webp?t=1754039836\" width=167 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303740/extras/90444ffcdd591e61f5139765cf104b95.avif?t=1754039836\" width=800 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Lamina</strong>, A shy <strong>Husky Girl</strong> that move to a big city, <strong>Nusanka</strong>. Just a day after moving there, she got a taste of\u00a0<strong>Pandemic</strong>. Which forcing her to\u00a0<strong>Quarantine</strong> herself in her own apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don't be a skill issue then got caught with those funny looking liquid, u gonna get Liquifed<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303740/extras/ffa4ae0717967020cf5422f280f2ad50.avif?t=1754039836\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0<i>This is Lamina after you being a skill issue</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(\u00a0 Flickering image warnings! For those who had sensitive flickering imagery )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303740/extras/d0b6fad73ae5f6c5a5f4b4f939cda961.webp?t=1754039836\" width=167 height=39 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Rich with <strong>6 Multiple Endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water ( Take a shower )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simequids ( No don't touch this things )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Computers ( It's time to not touch grass yeaahhhh )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303740/extras/305aafd935bebd19e1fc39ec8f76fa6d.webp?t=1754039836\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Bottle Flip</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute Friends ( Like u )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Art and Songs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking ( Let Her Cook )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created Mostly by one person</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 - 6 Hours of gameplay to get a single ending</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use her <strong>Computer</strong> to access things like, <strong>Shops, Marketplace, Media Social, Freelancing, Crypto Trading, Crypto Miner\u00a0</strong>and even<strong> Gambling</strong>, to help you survive the pandemic. The groceries prices are going expensive on each day. So make sure you prepared from the economy sides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is many items you can use to deal with them or survive, like <strong>Guns, Water Grenade, Water Trap, Water Galons, Water Bottle, Deodorant, FloffSoap</strong> and many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also <strong>Upgrade</strong> Lamina<strong>\u00a0stats</strong> using <strong>Upgrade Books</strong> or Using <strong>Upgradable items.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Other Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Other Other Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boykisser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303740/extras/d2a5bb9738eed1c54a5bedd699179faa.avif?t=1754039836\" width=128 height=128 /></span><i>This Boy1 is lurking at u waiting for u to touch the wishlist button</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303740/extras/d2a5bb9738eed1c54a5bedd699179faa.avif?t=1754039836\" width=128 height=128 /></span><i>This Boy2 is lurking at u waiting for u to touch the wishlist button</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303740/extras/d2a5bb9738eed1c54a5bedd699179faa.avif?t=1754039836\" width=128 height=128 /></span><i>This Boy3 is lurking at u waiting for u to touch the wishlist button</i></p>",
